      "width": 690,
      "height": 1046,
      "reading": "近照正面。靠左有绿底3号牌，石券罩在砖砌喇叭口前挑出，木门深藏于内，石级呈弧弓形。"
    },
    {
      "author": "高参88",
      "source_url": "https://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_5d1bdf480101ettg.html",
      "image_url": "https://s16.sinaimg.cn/mw690/001HIrzOgy72A4bc2lx0f&690",
